    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><p>After confirming and delivering a medication order, same can be returned back partially or fully to the respective inventory in the desired batch. User can refund the invoice for the returned medicines too.</p><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><h2>Used By</h2><p>This feature is used by Pharmacists and Cashiers in a hospital pharmacy.</p><h2>How is it Used?</h2><h3>1. Returning the medicine</h3><ol><li><p>Go to the Odoo - &ldquo;Sales Order&rdquo; screen under the &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; menu, which will be listing the confirmed medication sale orders.</p></li><li><p>Search for the desired patient&rsquo;s sale order and click on the same, to view the respective details.</p></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Delivery&rdquo; button appearing at the top right side.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"455\" ac:original-width=\"846\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-061526.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>In the &ldquo;Delivery&rdquo; screen, you can view the delivered quantity in the &ldquo;Done&rdquo; column for the listed products.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"338\" ac:original-width=\"693\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-062430.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Return&rdquo; button appearing at the top left side of the screen.</p></li><li><p>Update the quantity of drug to return in the &ldquo;Quantity&rdquo; field under the &ldquo;Reverse Transfer&rdquo; popup.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"229\" ac:original-width=\"524\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-062822.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Return&rdquo; button appearing at the bottom left corner of the popup.</p></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Force Availability&rdquo; button appearing at the top left side of the screen.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"290\" ac:original-width=\"763\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-063339.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Open &ldquo;Operations&rdquo; tab and click on the list icon&nbsp; appearing in the product grid.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"305\" ac:original-width=\"758\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-064422.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></li><li><p>Click on &ldquo;Add an Item&rdquo; link in the &ldquo;Lot/Serial Number Details&rdquo; popup, select the desired lot in which you want to add the returned quantity of drugs and enter the same quantity in the &ldquo;Done&rdquo; field.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"223\" ac:original-width=\"518\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-065406.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Save&rdquo; button in the popup and then click on &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button in the top left side of the screen.</p></li></ol><h3>2. Refunding the Invoice</h3><ol><li><p>To refund the invoice, click on the &ldquo;Invoices&rdquo; button appearing at the top right side for the confirmed sales order.</p></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Refund Invoice&rdquo; button appearing at the top left side of the screen.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"391\" ac:original-width=\"784\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-070547.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Select the desired &ldquo;Refund Method&rdquo; in the &ldquo;Refund Invoice&rdquo; popup.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"235\" ac:original-width=\"891\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-071052.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Enter the Refund Reason and Date in the respective fields accordingly and click on the &ldquo;Create Refund&rdquo; button at the bottom left side of the popup.</p></li><li><p>Open the Draft Refund record, click on the &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button appearing at the top right side of the screen and then click on the &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; button.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"392\" ac:original-width=\"833\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200401-071839.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>&nbsp;Select the Payment Journal and enter the Payment Amount in the respective fields under &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; popup and then click on &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button appearing at the bottom left side of the popup.</p></li><li><p>You can print the Refund Invoice by clicking the &ldquo;Print&rdquo; button and selecting the &ldquo;Invoices&rdquo; option.<br /> </p></li></ol></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:macro-id=\"74d2a540-6569-46c5-887d-a6c403d1c75a\" /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"07b9ef05-889d-4560-b10e-792d3accaed5\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Feature Details</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604205/Pharmacy+Management\">Feature Guide - Pharmacy Management </a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"70f609f8-bd50-4c41-b3ec-38c80cb4a056\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Implementation Details</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014590/Pharmacy+Configuration\">Implementer's Guide - ERP Modules - Pharmacy Configuration</a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"fixed-width\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><p /></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
